<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices slightly higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices slightly higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate prices were up slightly in flat trade and ammonia prices were higher in response to some recent domestic trades, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There's been some higher priced sales,&quot; said an ammonia dealer. &quot;All buyers were ammonia producers that had plants down.&quot;</p>
<p>				   Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-188		 up 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		165-175		 up 5</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
